#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:132
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "``[workflow.states.NAME]`` defines a state: ``next`` lists the states "
#| "the ``state`` command may move a record to, ``evidence = true`` asks "
#| "for ``--evidence`` on a move into it, and ``status`` is the text a "
#| "record's optional ``status`` field takes there. A state with no "
#| "``next`` is closed. Promotion is the only way from the draft state to "
#| "the open state, because it gives the number; a draft may move without "
#| "one only to the states its own ``next`` lists, such as ``abandoned``."
msgid ""
"``[workflow.states.NAME]`` defines a state. ``next`` lists the states the "
"``state`` command may move a record to. ``evidence = true`` asks for "
"``--evidence`` on a move into the state. ``status`` is the text a "
"record's optional ``status`` field takes there. A state with no ``next`` "
"is closed. Promotion is the only way from the draft state to the open "
"state, because promotion gives the number. Without a number, a draft may "
"move only to the states its own ``next`` lists, such as ``abandoned``."
msgstr ""
"``[workflow.states.NAME]`` は状態を定義する。\\ ``next`` は ``state`` "
"コマンドで記録を移せる状態の一覧。\\ ``evidence = true`` はその状態へ移すときに ``--evidence`` "
"を求める。\\ ``status`` は、記録の任意の ``status`` フィールドがその状態で取る文字列。\\ ``next`` "
"のない状態は閉じた状態になる。草案の状態から議論の状態へは、番号を付ける昇格でしか移れない。昇格せずに草案が移れるのは、自身の ``next`` "
"にある ``abandoned`` などの状態だけ。"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:139
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Numbers have at least ``width`` digits, padded with zeros. A number "
#| "that needs more digits gets them, so 10000 follows 9999, and lists "
#| "sort by value. Promotion numbers from ``start``; ``limit``, when set, "
#| "is the highest number it gives. Changing ``start`` or ``limit`` later "
#| "is safe. Changing ``width`` is not, once records are numbered: their "
#| "numbers would no longer match it."
msgid ""
"Numbers have at least ``width`` digits, padded with zeros. A number that "
"needs more digits gets them, so 10000 follows 9999, and lists sort by "
"value. Promotion numbers from ``start``. ``limit``, when set, is the "
"highest number it gives. Changing ``start`` or ``limit`` later is safe. "
"Changing ``width`` is not, once records are numbered: their numbers would "
"no longer match it."
msgstr ""
"番号は少なくとも ``width`` 桁で、足りない桁はゼロで埋める。もっと桁が必要な番号にはその桁数を使うので、9999 の次は 10000 "
"になり、一覧は値の順に並ぶ。昇格は ``start`` から番号を付け、\\ ``limit`` "
"を設定した場合はそれが付ける番号の上限になる。\\ ``start`` や ``limit`` は後から変えても安全。記録に番号が付いた後で "
"``width`` を変えるのは安全ではない。既存の番号がその桁数に合わなくなる。"

